      "title": "Baía da Esperança",
      "content": "<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-d4aeb34d-7fff-e649-b857-8f99ce98a150\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A região geográfica que abriga a nova </span><a href=\"#/topic/t-033353fe-5064-4eb3-9dbe-597ecbf31c4f\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-033353fe-5064-4eb3-9dbe-597ecbf31c4f\">Academia da Esperança.</a><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Situada em uma zona de fronteira crítica entre os territórios de </span><a href=\"#/topic/t-ddf02520-7f75-4657-935b-a7996d84eeaf\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-ddf02520-7f75-4657-935b-a7996d84eeaf\">Gehenna </a><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">e </span><a href=\"#/topic/t-f9eed48d-d3de-45af-aba5-7587f1e51cc0\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-f9eed48d-d3de-45af-aba5-7587f1e51cc0\">Trinity</a><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, a Baía é um local de contrastes brutais.</span></font></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Enquanto o campus da escola brilha com a modernidade e os investimentos recentes do </span><a href=\"#/topic/t-4fc8c9ed-ec19-4270-8f85-42b2c60f433f\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-4fc8c9ed-ec19-4270-8f85-42b2c60f433f\"><b>GSC</b></a><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, os arredores são marcados pelo abandono. A área externa é composta por ruas esburacadas, vegetação selvagem, fábricas desativadas e galpões em ruínas.</span></font></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Locais Conhecidos:</span></font></p><ul dir=\"ltr\"><li style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"#/topic/t-033353fe-5064-4eb3-9dbe-597ecbf31c4f\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-033353fe-5064-4eb3-9dbe-597ecbf31c4f\"><b>Academia da Esperança</b></a></font></li><li style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"#/topic/t-7c3aafc3-f98d-4507-8285-33fa585d1bf6\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-7c3aafc3-f98d-4507-8285-33fa585d1bf6\"><b>Ferro Velho</b></a></font></li><li style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"#/topic/t-f05d3c5a-040e-46a1-b40f-7e99ce76d08c\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-f05d3c5a-040e-46a1-b40f-7e99ce76d08c\"><b>Morro</b></a></font></li><li style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"#/topic/t-60bf7d27-318b-4456-a520-318ac2f929bb\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-60bf7d27-318b-4456-a520-318ac2f929bb\"><b>Navio Encalhado</b></a></font></li></ul>",
