      "content": "<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-0bbbefb0-7fff-ead7-3da5-5c9a6f95e4fe\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Um imenso navio de carga industrial que se encontra permanentemente encalhado na costa da </span></font><a href=\"#/topic/t-5b450ab2-6085-4bfd-9153-ab0cf59cbe48\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-5b450ab2-6085-4bfd-9153-ab0cf59cbe48\">Baía da Esperança,</a><font size=\"2\" face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> ao lado do </span></font><a href=\"#/topic/t-7c3aafc3-f98d-4507-8285-33fa585d1bf6\" class=\"wiki-link\" data-topic-id=\"t-7c3aafc3-f98d-4507-8285-33fa585d1bf6\">Ferro Velho</a><font size=\"2\" face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.</span></font></h3><font size=\"2\" face=\"Roboto\"></font>",
